        <title type="html"><![CDATA[fix: correct SubtleCrypto.deriveKey and its related dictionaries]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41112</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41112"/>
        <updated>2025-09-12T22:56:22.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/241506?u=13324b3ac27dc54cdde3ac635d567d0d96b88876&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This PR fixes <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/SubtleCrypto/deriveKey" rel="nofollow">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/SubtleCrypto/deriveKey</a> in a number of ways</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>removes HKDF and PBKDF2 as supported derived key algorithm, because it isn't and per the spec all implementations using this guidance result in OperationError.</li>
<li>adds AesDerivedKeyParams to link to from the fixed deriveKey</li>
<li>updates HmacImportParams to mention its use in deriveKey</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Readers are mislead into thinking they can use deriveKey into getting a KDF key.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a href="https://w3c.github.io/webcrypto/#aes-ctr-registration" rel="nofollow">https://w3c.github.io/webcrypto/#aes-ctr-registration</a> (or any of the AES-registrations)</li>
<li><a href="https://w3c.github.io/webcrypto/#hmac-registration" rel="nofollow">https://w3c.github.io/webcrypto/#hmac-registration</a></li>
<li><a href="https://w3c.github.io/webcrypto/#hkdf-registration" rel="nofollow">https://w3c.github.io/webcrypto/#hkdf-registration</a></li>
<li><a href="https://w3c.github.io/webcrypto/#pbkdf2-registration" rel="nofollow">https://w3c.github.io/webcrypto/#pbkdf2-registration</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2834169796" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/56931" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/nodejs/node/issues/56931/hovercard" href="https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/56931">nodejs/node#56931</a></p>]]></content>
